### VS Code'da "REST Client" kengaytmasini o'rnating, keyin har bir so'rov ustidagi "Send Request" ni bosing.
@api = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1) Admin bo'lib kirish
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Xodim bo'lib kirish (permissions: sotuv, ombor, xarajatlar, qaytarish)
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "dilnoza", "password": "123456" }

### Bosh sahifa
GET {{api}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ombor: barcha mahsulotlar
GET {{api}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ombor: faqat kam qolganlar
GET {{api}}/products?status=kam
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ombor: narxi oshganlar (dollar sababli)
GET {{api}}/products?status=oshgan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dollar kursini yangilash
POST {{api}}/rates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rate": 12900 }

### Sotuv (product ID larni /products dan oling)
POST {{api}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "product": "PRODUCT_ID", "quantity": 1 }],
  "paymentType": "naqd"
}

### Qaytarish: chekni qidirish
GET {{api}}/returns/search?slot=tushdan&amount=518000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Xarajat qo'shish
POST {{api}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Yetkazib berish uchun benzin", "amount": 180000, "category": "Transport" }

### Bugungi xarajatlar (jami va kim qancha)
GET {{api}}/expenses?period=today
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ta'minotchilar
GET {{api}}/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tez kirim
POST {{api}}/supplies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplier": "SUPPLIER_ID",
  "product": "PRODUCT_ID",
  "quantity": 10,
  "unitPrice": 238000,
  "currency": "UZS",
  "paid": 1500000
}

### Bugungi kirimlar va jami
GET {{api}}/supplies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Kunlik hisobot
GET {{api}}/reports/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Oylik hisobot
GET {{api}}/reports/monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
